.claude/

# The icon & item studio is a private editor for the app's own art. It reaches
# into js/ and would be served like any other page, so it stays off the repo
# and therefore off the published site. What it produces —
# js/ui/pixelart-overrides.js and js/skin/items-overrides.js — is committed;
# the tool that made it is not. (The same arrangement as Frame & Groove.)
tools/

# Nothing here is built, so there is no build output to ignore.
